# Ignore everything...
*

# ...except folders (so git can look inside them)
!*/

# ...and these file types
# scripts
!*.sh
!*.R
!*.py
# figures
!*.png
!*.jpeg
!*.jpg
!*.pdf
# text and data frames
!*.txt
!*.csv
!*.tsv

# ...and this file
!.gitignore
!README.md

# Folders to leave out completely
data/
sequencing_forms/
sampling/
NCBI_sub/
manuscript/
**/tools/
**/extras/
